            "key": "solution",
            "html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем не­ра­вен­ство:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"16x^2-8x+1-4|1-4x|&lt;0\\Leftrightarrow(4x-1)^2-4|1-4x|&lt;0.\"></span></p></center><p>Сде­лав за­ме­ну <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\left|1-4x\\right|\"></span>, по­лу­ча­ем не­ра­вен­ство <span data-inline-latex=\"t^{2}-4t\\lt 0\"></span>, от­ку­да  <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\lt t\\lt 4\"></span>,</p><p>Тогда: <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\lt \\left|4x-1\\right|\\lt 4\"></span>, от­ку­да  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3}{4}\\lt x\\lt \\frac{1}{4}\"></span>   или  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\\lt x\\lt \\frac{5}{4}\"></span> .</p>",
